# (1.5.0, step 7) a short film script, as tests/film's are written (`bar N` and the keys and knobs), for
# tests/host/cues_film_test.sh: two short songs in Set mode with a Mix, a ghost performer's moves in each (the DJ filter
# shut and ridden open, a chord throw, the kick muted a bar, Wail held, Whoop tapped, Freeze, Motion turned, Echo pushed
# in the outro; in the second, the bass soloed, Shut held), and one move after the music has stopped.
# Not a scenario of its own (tests/scenarios): cues_film.py runs it, compiles its moves into the set made from it.
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
spin K1 2
wait 300
spin K2 2
wait 300
expect par158 2
expect trans 2
# the last two pieces, so the set ends after them as the set file made of them will: Pressure, then Haze (each no
# intro, Main 32, Outro 16)
turn PRESET 7
wait 600
expect piece 7
tap HOME
wait 200
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K1 -4
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
expect piece 6
spin K1 -4
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 0
expect piece 6
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- the film ---
splash 0
film cues_film.film
bar 0 PRESSURE: the set starts
splashrun
spin SELECT -20
wait 200
expect playing 1
bar 2 the DJ filter opened over about two bars
turn SELECT 20 200
bar 4 a chord throw, 2 bars
tap SEL
key b0 down
bar 6 let go
key b0 up
bar 8 the kick muted a bar
tapkey w3
bar 9 back
tapkey w3
bar 10 Wail held 2 bars
key b7 down
bar 12 let go
key b7 up
bar 13 Whoop tapped
tapkey b8
bar 14 Freeze, a bar
key w13 down
bar 15 let go
key w13 up
bar 16 Motion up 10 (KNOB 3, the Form page), slowly
tap HOME
turn K3 10 300
bar 34 the outro: Echo pushed, 2 bars
tap SEL
key w11 down
bar 36 let go
key w11 up
bar 47 the last bar
wait 2600
expect piece 7
bar 2 HAZE: the bass soloed, 2 bars
tapkey b2
bar 4 the solo off
tapkey b2
bar 20 Shut, 2 bars
key w9 down
bar 22 let go
key w9 up
bar 47 the last bar (then it rests, the tails ringing)
wait 12000
expect playing 0
tapkey w5
filmstop
